{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24601","headline":"晚起闲行 · 白居易","name":"晚起闲行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皤然一老子，拥裘仍隐几。\n坐稳夜忘眠，卧安朝不起。\n起来无可作，闭目时叩齿。\n静对铜炉香，暖漱银瓶水。\n午斋何俭洁，饼与蔬而已。\n西寺讲楞伽，闲行一随喜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}